#: ../../technical/articles/007-windows-login-task-control-and-worker-authority.md:20
msgid ""
"The Windows process scope uses a noninherited Job Object configured with "
"kill-on-close and verifies that setting. It attaches each new process to "
"the job in `CreateProcessW` through the kernel job-list process "
"attribute, before child code can execute; it does not use a create-then-"
"assign interval. Launch requires absolute executable and working-"
"directory paths, an explicit environment, and no credential in "
"arguments/environment. Termination fences later launches, terminates the "
"job, waits for zero active members, and retains its job handle if it "
"cannot prove that condition. A separate task-engine ancestry check bounds"
" traversal and compares process creation times to reduce PID-reuse "
"ambiguity. The scope expressly excludes children created by external "
"brokers; job membership alone does not cover those (windows_process.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/windows_process.py`), "
"windows_process.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/windows_process.py`), "
"windows_process.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/windows_process.py`), "
"windows_task_process.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/windows_task_process.py`))."
msgstr ""
"A Windows-folyamathatókör nem örökölt Job Objectet használ, bezáráskori "
"megszüntetésre beállítva, és ellenőrzi ezt a beállítást. Minden új "
"folyamatot a `CreateProcessW` hívásban, a kernel job-list "
"folyamatattribútumával kapcsol a jobhoz, mielőtt a gyermek kódja "
"futhatna; nem használ létrehozás utáni hozzárendelési időablakot. Az "
"indításhoz abszolút futtathatóállomány- és munkakönyvtár-útvonal, "
"kifejezett környezet és hitelesítő adatoktól mentes "
"argumentumok/környezet szükséges. A megszüntetés tiltja a későbbi "
"indításokat, leállítja a jobot, megvárja a nulla aktív tagot, és "
"megtartja a job handle-jét, ha ezt nem tudja bizonyítani. Külön "
"feladatmotor-származásellenőrzés korlátozza a bejárást és összehasonlítja"
" a folyamatok létrehozási idejét a PID-újrafelhasználás kétértelműségének"
" csökkentésére. A hatókör kifejezetten kizárja a külső közvetítők által "
"létrehozott gyermekeket; a jobtagság önmagában azokra nem terjed ki "
"(windows_process.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/windows_process.py`), "
"windows_process.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/windows_process.py`), "
"windows_process.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/windows_process.py`), "
"windows_task_process.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/windows_task_process.py`))."

#: ../../technical/articles/007-windows-login-task-control-and-worker-authority.md:22
msgid ""
"The worker’s authorization channel is distinct from its operation/custody"
" channels. `WorkerAuthorizationServer` accepts only a verified worker "
"process with the expected owner, profile, and boot identity. It asks the "
"runtime-owned `WorkerAuthorizationOwner` for a narrowly typed permit "
"while a dedicated thread holds the profile guard, limits concurrent "
"authority channels to eight, and bounds permit expiry. Inventory permits "
"carry only a bounded inventory projection; response-scope permits cannot "
"be confused with effect permits. A held operation permit allows at most "
"one publication command. Automation approval publication is tied to the "
"exact commit action, approval/decline operation definition, request, "
"session, connection, operation, enrollment reference, and review digest. "
"A lost approval-phase reply triggers best-effort proof cleanup. The "
"worker client opens a separate native connection to its exact runtime "
"parent, validates boot and channel identities, requests authority, "
"performs the body, and acknowledges release on that same connection. "
"Async cancellation paths still settle acquisition/release before dropping"
" the lease. Approval passwords use the ready-then-secret flow, and lease "
"payloads are canonicalized, digest-checked, duplicate-key rejected, "
"schema-validated, and reassembled before the worker applies them "
"(worker_authorization.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/worker_authorization.py`), "
"worker_authorization_client.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/worker_authorization_client.py`), "
"worker_authorization_client.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/worker_authorization_client.py`), "
"worker_authorization_client.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/worker_authorization_client.py`), "
"worker_authorization_client.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/worker_authorization_client.py`), "
"worker_lease_transfer.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/worker_lease_transfer.py`), "
"worker_lease_transfer.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/local_runtime/worker_lease_transfer.py`))."
msgstr ""
"A munkafolyamat felhatalmazási csatornája különáll a műveleti/őrzési "
"csatornáitól. A `WorkerAuthorizationServer` csak az elvárt tulajdonossal,"
" profillal és indítási azonossággal rendelkező ellenőrzött "
"munkafolyamatot fogad el. Szűken típusos engedélyt kér a "
"futtatókörnyezethez tartozó `WorkerAuthorizationOwner` elemtől, miközben "
